Model

This software runs the Inkling-2-Mini model published by Thinking Machines Lab, Inc.
at https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini (revision
b85c3cfa615fc413cc9af3379f491b963f3b586a) under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The model weights are not included in this repository or in the container image;
they are downloaded from the original repository and converted locally. Use of the
model is also subject to the Thinking Machines Model Acceptable Use Policy:
https://thinkingmachines.ai/model-acceptable-use-policy/

