Tenstorrent tt-metal

This software is built on, links against at runtime, and its device kernels are
compiled with, Tenstorrent TT-Metalium / TTNN (https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal,
commit 79951bd44b7484a136b3619e0d81f26baa8a1936), Copyright Tenstorrent USA, Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The kernels under inkling_tt/kernels/
include tt-metal device headers and call its kernel APIs; no tt-metal source file is
copied into this repository. The container image built by serve/build_image.sh
contains a built tt-metal tree at /opt/tt-metal together with its own LICENSE and
NOTICE files, on the tt-metal dev image
ghcr.io/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tt-metalium/ubuntu-22.04-dev-amd64@sha256:47772e38d127584ac8d64b4632ebdd82e5cef574f787cdb319e8f687501535dc,
whose contents keep their own licenses.

