Hugging Face Transformers (adapted file)

serve/vllm_inkling/inkling_vllm_config.py is adapted from
src/transformers/models/inkling2_loop/configuration_inkling2_loop.py in
Hugging Face Transformers (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers, commit
be48e7a0b63d2ff22ce1ebccbccbd0374c1592ef), Copyright 2026 the HuggingFace Team,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Changes: made a standalone module for
transformers 5.12 (no relative imports, @strict and docstring decorators removed,
loop_config handled in __post_init__) and added AutoConfig registration. The file
keeps the original copyright and license header and states the modification.

tools/reference/ref_inkling.py and tools/golden/*.py are independent code. ref_inkling.py
re-implements the equations of the same Transformers eager model in plain torch;
the golden scripts call the Transformers API to record reference outputs.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
vLLM and vllm-tt-plugin

serve/vllm_inkling/ is a plugin bundle for vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm,
Apache License 2.0) and the Tenstorrent vLLM plugin
(https://github.com/tenstorrent/vllm-tt-plugin, commit
0e96e9eec1387bbc8e9a75457f2a31d67acdcf0a, Copyright Tenstorrent AI ULC, Apache
License 2.0). Neither is vendored. inkling_vllm_adapter.py implements the plugin's
model interface; it shares only interface names and capability keys with the plugin.
serve/install_vllm_venv.sh downloads both at install time.

