Prior art (design references, no code copied)

The bank-local expert-streaming readers (inkling_tt/experts_stream.py,
inkling_tt/kernels/experts/) were designed after the approach of the public
Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B P150 bundle (https://huggingface.co/raahemnabeel/qwen3-coder-30b-a3b,
revision 77c2b34da6ca2591d75bd17cedbefd6c1cbf6a09) and tt-metal's GPT-OSS fused
decode (models/demos/gpt_oss at the tt-metal commit above). The kernels were written
for this model. A line comparison against the 24 moe_decode files of that bundle
revision (2,047 distinct long lines) found only standard tt-metal include lines and
kernel-API boilerplate in common.
